    "chunk_text": "\u00feam domon \u00feyre Witodlice on \u00feisne timan nihtes se westenda engel ferde & Egyptiscere \u00feeode ealle frumcennede For \u00fei \u00feonne wacion we, \u00fee l\u00e6s we beon gemengede wi\u00f0 \u00fea Egyptiscean frecednysse. Eac \u00feam ylcan timan se H\u00e6lend on his godspelle his cyme toweardne cydde, \u00fea \u00fea he his \u00feeowas Cume he on \u00e6fen, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, cume he to middere nihte, cume he to hancrede, eadige beo\u00f0 \u00fea \u00fee he For \u00fei \u00feonne beo\u00f0 ge gearwe, for \u00feon ge nyton hwilcere tide mannes bearn cyme\u00f0. & witodlice na mid wordum anum \u00fe\u00e6t ure Drihten w\u00e6ccean t\u00e6hte, ac he hit eac mid his agenre So\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t godspel s\u00e6g\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se H\u00e6lend w\u00e6re ealle niht \u00feurhwuniende on \u00feam godcundlican Paulus eac & Silas, \u00fea hi w\u00e6ron on \u00feam folclican cwearterne, \u00fea to middere nihte geb\u00e6don hi hig & sona wear\u00f0 micel eor\u00f0byfung, & cwacedon \u00fea grundweallas, & \u00fea dura sylfwylles asprungon, & For \u00fei \u00feonne on \u00feam tidum us gebyra\u00f0 to singanne, & ura gebeda geornfulnysse to h\u00e6bbenne on An cyn gedwyldmanna is \u00fea wena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t halige w\u00e6ccan syn idele, & hi cw\u00e6\u00f0a\u00f0, Niht w\u00e6s geworht \u00dea gedwyldmen man h\u00e6t on Grecise Nictates, & we on ure ge\u00feeode slumeras hi magon o\u00f0\u00f0e Be d\u00e6gredsangum. Be d\u00e6gredsanges gefyrnysse & ealderlicnysse Dauid cw\u00e6",
